5,0,1,talk,Toshio,,"Let us begin. Since we have no information on this first day, I believe the most rational approach is to observe everyone's speech patterns and behavior.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. It's too early to make any assumptions, so we should focus on listening and seeing if any contradictions arise as we talk.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,I agree with both of you. A logical approach is best. Let's use this time to get a feel for everyone's communication style before we move toward any conclusions.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Minato,,"Hello everyone! I'm a bit nervous, but I'll do my best. I want to make sure we all get along while we try to find the werewolf. I'm looking forward to talking with you all!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. I believe a calm and patient approach is best. Let us maintain our composure and observe one another with a gentle mind as we begin this process.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Minato, your enthusiasm is noted, but remember that this game requires a certain level of suspicion. We must remain vigilant, even toward those who seem the most friendly.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Toshio is right. While friendliness is pleasant, we shouldn't let it cloud our judgment. We need to stay objective if we want to protect the village.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Minato, don't be too nervous. While I agree with Toshio and Misaki that we must be vigilant, we should also maintain a cooperative atmosphere. It will make it easier to spot anomalies in behavior.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Toshio"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Minato,,"I understand! I'll try my best to be vigilant too. I just don't want anyone to feel sad. Thank you for being so kind to me, Mizuki! I'll watch everyone very carefully.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is heartening to see such a supportive atmosphere. Let us continue to speak openly; often, the truth reveals itself in the quietest moments of a conversation.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Toshio,,I have nothing further to add at this moment. I will continue to observe.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Skip"",""tail"":""Skip.""}]}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'll do the same. Since we've established our general approach, I'll spend the remaining turns observing how everyone reacts to the silence.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,I will also pass for now. Let's see if anyone feels the need to break the silence or if there are any hidden thoughts that emerge as we approach the end of the day.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Minato,,"I'll skip too! I'm just thinking about how everyone is talking. It's a bit scary, but I'm curious to see what happens tomorrow. I hope we can all be friends!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I shall also skip. I find a certain peace in this quiet observation. Let us see what the first night brings to light.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
