23,0,4,talk,Minato,,Over! I hope everyone has a good night. See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,Over. I wish you all a peaceful night. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
